    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 As Water Dragon Fafurion's lieutenant, this Evil Spirit defeated countless disciples of the gods. Known as Sika of Storm during the War of the Gods, he is a veteran warrior and an engaging storyteller. Currently, he travels the world and tells stories at the command of Fafurion. Giants Lv. 11 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Giants. P. Atk. +7% Max HP +7% Attack Range +15 Resistance to Shock +20% Resistance to Dagger +10% Resistance to Dual Dagger +10% Accuracy -5 Resistance to Spear -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
